  moveName: Discharge
  description: "Rush in the designated direction surrounded by an electric field
    that deals periodic damage. Direct contact deals additional damage and stuns
    for 0.35s. A direct hit grants one second use within 3s after the rush ends.
    The second rush is faster, travels 30% less far, and has a 30% smaller field.
    Enemies hit by its field or direct contact are slowed by 20% for 1s. Full
    Volt Absorb is consumed to extend travel distance for both passes. Walls stop
    the rush. Upgrade strengthens the second-pass slow to 35%."
